Package: mica-busybox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mica OS <hi@micaos.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: BusyBox binary for diagnostics, without applet links
 One file, /usr/bin/busybox: the upstream BusyBox release compiled statically
 for this architecture, so it runs with none of the root's libraries. Applets
 are reached by name (`busybox sh`, `busybox ip`); no applet link is installed,
 so the GNU tools remain the command set and nothing in PATH changes.
